<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="M-Sec Technology Consulting — Solutions IT professionnelles : Connectivité, Infrastructure, Cybersécurité, CCTV, Maintenance. Kinshasa, Afrique Centrale." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
  <title>M-Sec Technology Consulting | Infrastructure IT • Cybersécurité • Connectivité</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #000000;
      --bg2: #0a0a0a;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --border-h: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      --text: #e8e8e8;
      --text2: #666677;
      --text-bright: #ffffff;
      --blue: #3b82f6;
      --blue-g: rgba(59,130,246,0.08);
      --blue-br: #60a5fa;
      --green: #22c55e;
      --green-g: rgba(34,197,94,0.08);
      --orange: #f97316;
      --orange-g: rgba(249,115,22,0.08);
      --red: #ef4444;
      --red-g: rgba(239,68,68,0.08);
      --purple: #a855f7;
      --purple-g: rgba(168,85,247,0.08);
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    ul, ol { list-style: none; }

    /* ─── Typography ─── */
    .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blue-br);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-desc {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      max-width: 580px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* ─── Buttons ─── */
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--text-bright);
      color: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--text-bright);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--blue-br);
      border-color: var(--blue-br);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* ─── Navigation ─── */
    .nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      padding: 1rem 0;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .nav.scrolled {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--text-bright);
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--text2); font-weight: 400; }
    .logo em { font-style: normal; color: var(--blue-br); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-bright); }
    .nav-links .nav-cta-link {
      color: var(--text-bright); font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8125rem; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links .nav-cta-link:hover { border-color: var(--text-bright); background: var(--card); }

    .mob-btn { display: none; background: none; border: none; color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; padding: 0.5rem; }
    .mob-menu {
      display: none; position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
    }
    .mob-menu.open { display: flex; }
    .mob-menu a { color: var(--text2); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }

    /* ─── Hero ─── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero-inner { max-width: 900px; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.375rem 1rem; border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text2);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .hero-badge-dot {
      width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green); margin-right: 0.25rem;
      animation: pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse-dot { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.3; } }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: var(--text-bright);
    }
    .hero h1 .line { display: block; }
    .hero h1 .accent {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-br) 0%, var(--purple) 50%, var(--blue-br) 100%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      animation: shimmer 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes shimmer { 0%, 100% { background-position: 0% center; } 50% { background-position: 200% center; } }

    .hero .subtitle {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
      color: var(--text2);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .hero .btn-group { justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }

    /* Hero stats */
    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero-stat-n { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-bright); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .hero-stat-l { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-top: 0.25rem; }

    /* ─── Sections ─── */
    section { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .sw { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8rem 2rem; }
    .sw-narrow { max-width: 800px; }
    .sh { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
    .sh-center { text-align: center; }
    .sh-center .section-desc { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .sw-sep { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 0; }

    /* ─── Service Cards ─── */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .svc-card {
      position: relative;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .svc-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-h);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    .svc-icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .svc-icon.blue { background: var(--blue-g); }
    .svc-icon.green { background: var(--green-g); }
    .svc-icon.orange { background: var(--orange-g); }
    .svc-icon.red { background: var(--red-g); }
    .svc-icon.purple { background: var(--purple-g); }

    .svc-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-bright);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .svc-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .svc-features li {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      padding: 0.3rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.125rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .svc-features li::before {
      content: '→';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--blue-br);
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .svc-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: var(--blue-g);
      color: var(--blue-br);
      border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15);
    }

    /* ─── Differentiator ─── */
    .diff-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .diff-item { padding: 2rem 0; }
    .diff-item h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-bright); }
    .diff-item p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }

    /* ─── Methodology ─── */
    .method-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .method-step {
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-right: none;
      position: relative;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .method-step:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .method-step:hover { background: var(--card); }
    .method-num {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--blue-br);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .method-step h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .method-step p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }

    /* ─── Audit Section ─── */
    .audit-section {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg2) 100%);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .audit-inner {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .audit-benefits { padding-top: 1rem; }
    .audit-benefit {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .audit-benefit:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .audit-benefit-icon {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--green-g);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.125rem;
    }
    .audit-benefit h4 { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; color: var(--text-bright); }
    .audit-benefit p { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ─── Form ─── */
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .form-group input,
    .form-group select,
    .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
      outline: none;
    }
    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group select:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--blue-br);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    .form-group textarea { min-height: 100px; resize: vertical; }
    .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .form-submit { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }

    /* ─── Trust Badges ─── */
    .trust-badges {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .trust-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text2);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .trust-badge svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; color: var(--blue-br); }

    /* ─── CTA Section ─── */
    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
    }
    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .cta-section p {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .cta-section .btn-group { justify-content: center; }

    /* ─── Footer ─── */
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .footer-brand p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
    .footer h4 {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .footer a {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text2);
      padding: 0.3rem 0;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer a:hover { color: var(--text-bright); }
    .footer-bottom {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 2rem auto 0;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text2);
    }

    /* ─── Responsive ─── */
    @media(max-width:900px) {
      .method-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .method-step:nth-child(2) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .audit-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    }
    @media(max-width:768px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .mob-btn { display: block; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem); }
      .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .method-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .method-step, .method-step:last-child, .method-step:nth-child(2) { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: none; }
      .method-step:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; text-align: center; }
      .btn-group { flex-direction: column; }
      .btn-group a { justify-content: center; }
    }
    @media(max-width:480px) {
      .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ════════ NAVIGATION ════════ -->
<nav class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">M-<em>SEC</em> <span>Technology</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#methodology">Méthodologie</a>
      <a href="#audit">Audit Gratuit</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta-link">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <button class="mob-btn" id="mobBtn" aria-label="Menu">
      <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="mob-menu" id="mobMenu">
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#methodology">Méthodologie</a>
    <a href="#audit">Audit Gratuit</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
      Consulting IT — Afrique Centrale
    </div>
    <h1>
      <span class="line">Architecte de votre</span>
      <span class="line accent">infrastructure IT.</span>
      <span class="line">Gardien de vos données.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      M-Sec Technology Consulting déploie des solutions de connectivité haute performance, 
      d'infrastructure réseau et de cybersécurité active pour garantir la continuité de vos opérations.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="#audit" class="btn-primary">Solliciter un Audit Gratuit</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-secondary">Découvrir nos Expertises</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><div class="hero-stat-n">99.9%</div><div class="hero-stat-l">SLA Disponibilité</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-n">2h</div><div class="hero-stat-l">Temps de réponse</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-n">15+</div><div class="hero-stat-l">Certifications</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-n">4</div><div class="hero-stat-l">Pôles d'expertise</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════ SERVICES ════════ -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="sw">
    <div class="sh">
      <div class="section-label">Expertise Technique</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Nos Pôles de Compétences</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Chaque intervention suit notre doctrine : sécuriser dès le premier câble, performer au-delà des standards.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <!-- Service 1: Connectivité -->
      <div class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-icon blue">🌐</div>
        <h3>Connectivité &amp; Réseaux Haute Performance</h3>
        <p>Déploiement de solutions internet professionnelles avec basculement automatique (failover) pour une disponibilité maximale.</p>
        <ul class="svc-features">
          <li>Starlink Professionnel — zones isolées ou exigeantes</li>
          <li>Fibre Optique FTTH — débit symétrique garanti</li>
          <li>Antennes PtP/PtMP — réseaux privés longue portée</li>
          <li>Wi-Fi Entreprise — UniFi, couverture optimale</li>
          <li>Failover automatique — fibre + Starlink redondants</li>
          <li>Équipements Cisco, pare-feux, gestion du trafic</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="svc-tag">Réseau Résilient</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 2: Infrastructure -->
      <div class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-icon orange">🏗️</div>
        <h3>Infrastructure Physique &amp; Déploiement</h3>
        <p>Infrastructure câblée aux normes, documentée et évolutive. De la salle serveur jusqu'au poste de travail.</p>
        <ul class="svc-features">
          <li>Câblage structuré Cat6/Cat6a aux normes TIA/EIA</li>
          <li>Fibre monomode inter-bâtiments</li>
          <li>Baies de brassage, patch panels étiquetés</li>
          <li>Racking, installation et configuration équipements</li>
          <li>Documentation complète et certification</li>
          <li>Architecture évolutive et scalable</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="svc-tag" style="background:var(--orange-g);color:var(--orange);border-color:rgba(249,115,22,0.15)">Normes TIA/EIA</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 3: Cybersécurité -->
